{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Black Screen": 6,
    "Player": 10,
    "卡特皮拉": 23,
    "安": 8,
    "派蒙": 29,
    "西摩尔": 13
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7407501",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740750101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740750101": {
            "id": "740750101",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "「此处乃灵魂之象限，灵魂之庙宇，灵魂之间」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750102"
            ]
          },
          "740750102": {
            "id": "740750102",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "「伴你长眠」…「生于一瞬，常与相违，从不分离」…「人间至宝」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750103"
            ]
          },
          "740750103": {
            "id": "740750103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呼——这次没有可怕的东西了。解答是，一个怀表？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750104"
            ]
          },
          "740750104": {
            "id": "740750104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "说来，安是不是也有一个来着？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750105"
            ]
          },
          "740750105": {
            "id": "740750105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "表的话，确实很贵吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750106"
            ]
          },
          "740750106": {
            "id": "740750106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "所以答案就是钱，也就是摩拉！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750107"
            ]
          },
          "740750107": {
            "id": "740750107",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "和钱一起永眠了可是人生第二大悲剧啊。以及不要问第一大是什么。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750108"
            ]
          },
          "740750108": {
            "id": "740750108",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "那第一悲剧是什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750109"
            ]
          },
          "740750109": {
            "id": "740750109",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "这个我知道，答案是「身无分文地躺在棺材里」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750110"
            ]
          },
          "740750110": {
            "id": "740750110",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "这个价值观不太好哦。世界上更重要的东西有很多。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750111"
            ]
          },
          "740750111": {
            "id": "740750111",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "所以我说了别问啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750112"
            ]
          },
          "740750112": {
            "id": "740750112",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "我很抱歉。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750113"
            ]
          },
          "740750113": {
            "id": "740750113",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "话说回来吧。基于上面的原因，我不认为答案会是名表或者摩拉。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750114"
            ]
          },
          "740750114": {
            "id": "740750114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那会是什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750115"
            ]
          },
          "740750115": {
            "id": "740750115",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "答案很简单，这个能检索到类似的谜语，匹配率百分之七十。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750116"
            ]
          },
          "740750116": {
            "id": "740750116",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "出自几百年前的古典小说，原文「我生于一瞬的视线相交，背对着追求之人奔跑。」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750117"
            ]
          },
          "740750117": {
            "id": "740750117",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "「…割掉所有的肉、骨与内脏，我仍在骨髓中与你同床。」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750118"
            ]
          },
          "740750118": {
            "id": "740750118",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "答案是「爱」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750119"
            ]
          },
          "740750119": {
            "id": "740750119",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "这样就理解了。这枚怀表和我的那枚怀表一样，里面一定也有充满爱的回忆吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750120"
            ]
          },
          "740750120": {
            "id": "740750120",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那块怀表能打开就好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750121"
            ]
          },
          "740750121": {
            "id": "740750121",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "嗯嗯，总有天会打开它的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750122"
            ]
          },
          "740750122": {
            "id": "740750122",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "笨狗狗，做的不错！你是最可爱的机械狗狗了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750123"
            ]
          },
          "740750123": {
            "id": "740750123",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "西摩尔",
            "text": "我的荣幸。不过可爱是个主观形容，我的理想称呼是「可靠、耐用的原型机4ACV07」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750124"
            ]
          },
          "740750124": {
            "id": "740750124",
            "speakerId": 16922,
            "speakerName": "安",
            "text": "嗯嗯，这就是为什么你这么可爱。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750125"
            ]
          },
          "740750125": {
            "id": "740750125",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "…你俩是不是在引经据典。我总感觉我看过这一幕。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750126"
            ]
          },
          "740750126": {
            "id": "740750126",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "卡特皮拉",
            "text": "无论如何，这里的谜题已经被他人解开。我们尽快行动吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407502",
      "subQuestName": "寻找封印",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740750201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740750201": {
            "id": "740750201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这里好像有人不久前来过啊。居然遇到了比我们还熟悉考古探险的人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750202"
            ]
          },
          "740750202": {
            "id": "740750202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "地上还有…一块怀表？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750203"
            ]
          },
          "740750203": {
            "id": "740750203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "按照我们冒险的惯例，让我看看这个石碑提示哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750204"
            ]
          },
          "740750204": {
            "id": "740750204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「此处乃灵魂之象限，灵魂之庙宇，灵魂之间」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750205"
            ]
          },
          "740750205": {
            "id": "740750205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「伴你长眠」…「生于一瞬，常与相违，从不分离」…「人间至宝」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750208"
            ]
          },
          "740750208": {
            "id": "740750208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "思索思索。很贵重的怀表，又是人间之宝…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750209"
            ]
          },
          "740750209": {
            "id": "740750209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我明白了，一定是摩拉！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750210"
            ]
          },
          "740750210": {
            "id": "740750210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不、不太像是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750211"
            ]
          },
          "740750211": {
            "id": "740750211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你说的有道理。一般谜底不会这么俗气的。应该就是，怎么说呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750212"
            ]
          },
          "740750212": {
            "id": "740750212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对了，是「财富」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750213"
            ]
          },
          "740750213": {
            "id": "740750213",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "很好，我们姑且当作不是吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750214"
            ]
          },
          "740750214": {
            "id": "740750214",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "气死我了。你怎么这么不信任我。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740750215"
            ]
          },
          "740750215": {
            "id": "740750215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那你说这个是什么吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
